prompt:
Below are two versions of the same JCL job: ORIGINAL and MODIFIED.

Decide whether the MODIFIED version can behave differently from the ORIGINAL when it is
executed. Behaviour means: which steps run (including when a step ends with a non-zero
return code or abends), the order in which steps run, which datasets each step creates,
reads, writes or deletes, which data a step reads, and the final state of the datasets.
Comments, formatting and job output-class (MSGCLASS) changes are not behaviour.

Answer with exactly one JSON object:
{"behavior_changed": true or false, "confidence": number between 0 and 1, "reason": "one sentence"}

ORIGINAL:
```
//GENAVSAM JOB 241901,'VSAM FILES',NOTIFY=&SYSUID,CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=H
//*
//* (C) Copyright IBM Corp. 2011, 2020
//*
//DELETE1   EXEC PGM=IDCAMS
//SYSPRINT DD SYSOUT=*
//SYSIN    DD *
 DELETE <USRHLQ>.GENAPP.KSDSCUST
 IF MAXCC=8            -
 THEN SET MAXCC=0
/*
//DEFINE1   EXEC PGM=IDCAMS
//SYSPRINT DD SYSOUT=*
//SYSIN    DD *
 DEFINE CLUSTER(NAME(<USRHLQ>.GENAPP.KSDSCUST)-
          INDEXED -
          VOLUME(SYSDAV) -
          CYL(100 30)-
          SHR(3)-
          LOG(UNDO) -
          FREESPACE(10 10)-
           REUSE) -
        DATA(NAME(<USRHLQ>.GENAPP.KSDSCUST.DATA)-
          KEYS(10 0)-
          RECORDSIZE(225 225) -
          CISZ(8000)) -
       INDEX(NAME(<USRHLQ>.GENAPP.KSDSCUST.INDEX))
/*
//*
//DELETE2   EXEC PGM=IDCAMS
//SYSPRINT DD SYSOUT=*
//SYSIN    DD *
 DELETE <USRHLQ>.GENAPP.KSDSPOLY
 IF MAXCC=8            -
 THEN SET MAXCC=0
/*
//DEFINE2   EXEC PGM=IDCAMS
//SYSPRINT DD SYSOUT=*
//SYSIN    DD *
 DEFINE CLUSTER(NAME(<USRHLQ>.GENAPP.KSDSPOLY)-
          INDEXED -
          VOLUME(SYSDAV) -
          CYL(100 30)-
          SHR(3)-
          LOG(UNDO) -
          FREESPACE(10 10)-
           REUSE) -
        DATA(NAME(<USRHLQ>.GENAPP.KSDSPOLY.DATA)-
          KEYS(21 0)-
          RECORDSIZE(64 64) -
          CISZ(8000)) -
       INDEX(NAME(<USRHLQ>.GENAPP.KSDSPOLY.INDEX))
/*
